\documentclass[11pt]{article}
\usepackage[margin=2.2cm]{geometry}

\title{Station Card: Garde Manger}
\author{Bistro Aurelia --- Kitchen Office}
\date{September 2026}

\begin{document}
\maketitle

\section*{Opening Checks}

Tick off each line before the first cover is seated.

\begin{itemize}
\item Sanitise the board and swap in a fresh towel.
\item Temper the duck terrine twenty minutes before service.
\item Check the aspic tray for a clean set.
\item Log the fridge temperature on the HACCP sheet.
\end{itemize}

\section*{Closing Checks}

Initials go on the sheet once everything below is done.

\begin{itemize}
\item Wrap and date the p\^at\'e en cro\^ute.
\item Break down the slicer and oil the blade guard.
\item Soak the terrine moulds in cold water, never hot.
\item Wipe the marble slab and cover it for the night.
\end{itemize}

\end{document}

